(The Custodian leads you out of the treehouse, out of the forest itself, to look down on) Tj
T*
(the green expanse from above. Twisting stone spires break through the treeline, each) Tj
T*
(with a flame flickering in its tower like a beacon. "There's a relay out west," she) Tj
T*
(says, "maybe a few hours. You might have felt it on the way in: its light was weaker) Tj
T*
(than it should be. I think something's wrong with its Keeper, and I fear what happens if) Tj
T*
(that fire goes out." She studies the horizon. "When you're ready, come back. I'll give) Tj
T*
(you my map, so you can make it there safe. It's good to have heroes in the preserve) Tj
T*
(again.") Tj
